{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The light has faded, and the world has sunk into silence and darkness.<br>Only one beacon rises above the endless expanse, and only you can ignite its light.<br>To awaken the beacon, you must journey through gloomy locations and collect the stars scattered across the world.<br>Each one is a fragment of the lost light, and only by gathering them all will you be able to dispel the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Luminaria</strong> is a meditative journey where the focus is not on speed but on atmosphere.<br>The world responds to your presence, and your path is filled with soft radiance that step by step brings back hope.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The sole grand goal</strong> \u2014 collect all the stars to activate the main beacon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric world</strong> \u2014 a blend of darkness and light in a minimalist visual style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meditative gameplay</strong> \u2014 no battles or timers, just you and a peaceful adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smooth animation and light effects</strong> \u2014 creating the feeling of a living world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Musical accompaniment</strong> \u2014 a gentle soundtrack that enhances the atmosphere of the journey.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3948620?t=1756800565","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3948620?t=1756800565","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948620/ae2d3f682edb5254b71dc17e796c563da8954b60/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756800565","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948620/ae2d3f682edb5254b71dc17e796c563da8954b60/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756800565","categories":[{"description":"Si